{title: Deewana Dil Deewana}
{artist: Amit Kumar Udit Narayan Jatin Lalit}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] Deewa [G] na dil [Am] deewana,        [Am] Deewa [G] na dil [Am] deewana
[Am] Kab se kare hai [Em] tera intezar,        [Am] Kab aayegi meri [Em] jaan-e-bahaar
[G] Ke jitna hi behl [Am] aaoon,        [G] Yeh utna hi machalta [Am] hai dil
[Am] Andaz [D] dikhlaati,        [G] sau sau [Am] tarah ke
[Am] Jalwe [D] lutaati [G] huyi,        [G] Aati hogi [Am] mausam ke sath
[G] Gulshan khilati huyi,        [Am] Aa bhi [G] ja ab jaan-e- [Am] jaan
[Am] Deewa [G] na dil [Am] deewana...        [Am] Dil se [D] laga karke
[G] rakha hai [Am] ab tak,        [Am] Resham ka [D] tera [G] rumal
[G] Aage kahoon kya [Am] jaan-e-man,        [G] Aa dekh ja mera haal
[Am] Aa bhi [G] ja ab jaan-e- [Am] jaan,        [Am] Deewa [G] na dil [Am] deewana..
[Am] Toota [D] sitara to,        [G] maanga tha [Am] Rab se
[Am] Tujhko hi [D] jaan-e- [G] wafaa,        [G] Jo toot jaayein [Am] taare tamaam
[G] Maangun wohi ek dua,        [Am] Aa bhi [G] ja ab jaan-e- [Am] jaan
[Am] Deewa [G] na dil [Am] deewana..
